    {
      "v": 9,
      "zh": "你要生一个儿子，他必作太平的人；我必使他安静，不被四围的仇敌扰乱。他的名要叫所罗门（就是太平的意思）。他在位的日子，我必使以色列人平安康泰。",
      "en": "Look, you will have a son, who will be a peaceful man.[NOTE:1] I will give him rest from all his enemies on every side.[NOTE:2] Indeed, Solomon[NOTE:3] will be his name; I will give Israel peace and quiet during his reign.[NOTE:4]",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “man of rest.”",
        "Heb “his enemies all around.”",
        "The name Solomon (שְׁלֹמֹה, shelomoh) sounds like (and may be derived from) the Hebrew word for “peace” (שָׁלוֹם, shalom).",
        "Heb “in his days.”"
      ],
